+V+AgPrc:et%>^Am^A K ;

! ! Derivation
+V+Der/minen+N:etämi xnen ;

LEXICON v1  !!≈ * **@CODE@** sanoa, lukea, antaa:anta  GOLD
+V+Inf:%>^A KK ;
+V+Act+Ind+Prs+Sg1:^WG%>n K ;
+V+Act+Ind+Prs+Sg2:^WG%>t K ;
