+V+Act+Cond+Sg2+Err/Orth:%>^E2Isit K ;
+V+Act+Cond+Sg3:%>i4s K ;
+V+Act+Cond+Sg3+Err/Orth:%>^E2Is K ;
+V+Act+Cond+Sg3+Err/Orth:%>i4si K ; 
