!! ## Subparadigms
!! ### Conditional forms

LEXICON 2cond !!≈ **@CODE@**  for -imm^A
+Sg1:%>in K ; ! 
+Sg2:%>it K ;
+Sg3: K ;
+Pl1:%>imm^A K ;
+Pl1+Err/Orth:%>im^A K ;
+Pl2:%>itt^A K ;
+Pl3:%>iv^A K ;
+Pl3:%>ivv^A K ;
+Pl3+Err/Orth:%>iv^At K ;
+Pl3:%>it K ;

LEXICON 3cond !!≈ **@CODE@**  for -im^A
+Sg1:%>in K ; ! 
+Sg2:%>it K ;
+Sg3: K ;
+Pl1:%>im^A K ;
+Pl1+Err/Orth:%>imm^A K ;
+Pl2:%>itt^A K ;
+Pl3:%>iv^A K ;
+Pl3+Err/Orth:%>iv^At K ;
+Pl3:%>it K ;


!! ### Infinitive paradigms

LEXICON 3infcase
+Ill:%>^HMETAmh^A^An K ; ! 
+Ine:%>m^Ass^A K ;
+Ela:%>m^Ast^A K ;
+Ade:%>m^All^A K ; ! TODO -la / -lla
+Abe:%>m^Att^A K ;


